VoltFlow - IEC 61850 GOOSE configuration validator

Backend (from the root directory):
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000

Frontend:
cd voltflow-ui
npm install
npm run dev

The frontend calls http://localhost:8000 by default. To use another backend URL,
copy voltflow-ui/.env.example to voltflow-ui/.env.local and set VITE_API_URL.

Tests (from the root directory):
python -m pytest

Frontend checks:
cd voltflow-ui
npm run lint
npm run build

The local database (voltflow.db) is rebuilt automatically when its schema changes;
re-upload your SCL files afterwards.

Reports (also available from "Export report" in the UI):
GET  /api/v1/report.html          printable validation report (print to PDF from the browser)
GET  /api/v1/report/links.csv     every link with per-parameter results
GET  /api/v1/report/findings.csv  every finding with its IEC 61850 reference
POST /api/v1/compare              compare two versions of a file (form fields: before, after;
                                  ?format=html for a printable page); nothing is stored
